ISO-10303-21;
/* Pmi014: two ANNOTATION_PLANEs: one unbounded PLANE, one PLANAR_BOX; receivers supporting only one form lose the bounded hint or fail to import the unbounded annotation plane; the defect is a presentation/PMI property the shape-count oracles cannot observe, and here it also sits unreachable from the shape-rep root (product chain roots a GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET stub), so OCC loads only a 1-vertex stub (shape(1)); byte-present but oracle-invisible to the load-time shape-count oracles */
